    <string name="genre_desc_general">No automatic changes. Use the options in Settings and the profile below.</string>
    <string name="genre_desc_moba">Network-focused: lag spike alerts, ping and jitter on the HUD, match and countdown timers, RAM clean and Do Not Disturb.</string>
    <string name="genre_desc_shooter">Response-focused: highest refresh rate, Turbo, lag alerts, touch boost (if supported) and Auto Cool at 46°C.</string>
    <string name="genre_desc_br">Long-match mode: like Shooter, plus match timer and countdown timers on the HUD.</string>
    <string name="genre_desc_racing">Smoothness-focused: highest refresh rate, Turbo, CPU/GPU monitor and Auto Cool at 46°C.</string>
    <string name="genre_desc_rpg">Long-session mode: 60 Hz to save power, Auto Cool at 44°C, power draw monitor and a break reminder every hour.</string>

